Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:10.31,AM,,0,0,0,,በደጋው ላይ ባለች አንዲት መንደር፣ አልማዝ የምትባል ሴት ትኖር ነበር።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}In a village in the highlands, there lived a woman named Almaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.01,0:00:20.64,AM,,0,0,0,,ባሏ ከጦርነት ተመለሰ። ልቡ ግን እዚያው ርቆ ቀረ።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}Her husband came home from the war, but his heart stayed far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.34,0:00:27.13,AM,,0,0,0,,አያናግራትም፣ ፈገግም አይልላትም። አልማዝ ምን እንደምታደርግ ጨነቃት።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}He no longer spoke to her or smiled at her. Almaz did not know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.83,0:00:39.05,AM,,0,0,0,,ወደ ጠቢቡ አዋቂ ሄዳ፣ የፍቅር መድኃኒት እንዲያዘጋጅላት ለመነችው።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}She went to the wise old healer and begged him for a love potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:45.91,AM,,0,0,0,,«አዘጋጅልሻለሁ» አላት። «ግን ከሕያው አንበሳ አገጭ ሦስት ጢም አምጪልኝ።»\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}"I will make it," he said, "but bring me three whiskers from the chin of a living lion."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.61,0:00:53.87,AM,,0,0,0,,በየቀኑ ትኩስ ሥጋ ይዛ ወደ አንበሳው ዋሻ ሄደች። በየቀኑም ትንሽ ትንሽ ቀረበች።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}Every day she carried fresh meat to the lion's rocks, and every day she came a little closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.57,0:00:59.30,AM,,0,0,0,,ሳምንታት አለፉ። አንበሳው ሲያያት ማጓራቱን ተወ።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}Weeks passed. When the lion saw her coming, he no longer roared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:09.54,AM,,0,0,0,,አንድ ምሽት እየበላ ሳለ፣ በእርጋታ ከአገጩ ሦስት ጢም ነቀለች።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}One evening, while he ate, she gently plucked three whiskers from his chin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:15.53,AM,,0,0,0,,በኩራት ለአዋቂው ሰጠችው። እርሱ ግን ወደ እሳቱ ወረወራቸው።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}Proudly, she gave them to the healer. He threw them into the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.23,0:01:24.20,AM,,0,0,0,,«የዱር አንበሳን በትዕግሥት፣ በድፍረትና በገርነት አላመድሽው። ባልሽን ለመመለስ አስማት አያስፈልግሽም።»\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}"You tamed a wild lion with patience, courage and gentleness. You need no magic to win back your husband."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:32.37,AM,,0,0,0,,አልማዝ ወደ ቤቷ ተመለሰች። ቀስ በቀስ፣ በትዕግሥት፣ እንደገና ጀመረች።\N{\fnDejaVu Sans\b0\fs25\c&H00E8F4FF&}Almaz went home. Slowly and patiently, she began again.
